 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Logical nuances and syntactic order",
     "texto": [
      "In formal reasoning three basic relations are clearly distinguished: **1. Consecutive causality (deshalb, deswegen):** explains the direct logical effect of a prior fact: **Die Nachfrage stieg stark; deshalb bauten wir die Kapazitäten aus.** **2. Concessive restriction (dennoch, trotzdem):** presents an unexpected consequence that challenges the admitted difficulty: **Die Rohstoffpreise waren hoch; dennoch erzielte der Betrieb einen Gewinn.** **3. Argumentative addition (außerdem, darüber hinaus):** adds a complementary argument as reinforcement: **Der Entwurf spart Energie; außerdem senkt er die Produktionskosten.** All of them are sentence adverbs that trigger immediate subject inversion when they begin the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Connector",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Logical relation",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Illustrative example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "deshalb / deswegen",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Direct consequence",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das Projekt war erfolgreich; deshalb erhielten wir neue Aufträge.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "dennoch / trotzdem",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Unexpected concessive opposition",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das Risiko war hoch; dennoch stimmte der Vorstand dem Plan zu.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "außerdem / zudem",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Addition and sum of arguments",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Der Vertrag bietet Schutz; außerdem garantiert er faire Preise.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
